  Elixir/Hex direct dependencies  34 of 34 checked: Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD, ISC.
                                  No copyleft found. Re-run as a CI step.
                                  All are compatible with an MIT-licensed project.
  npm (web/)                      Direct dependencies: Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD, ISC.
                                  Transitive tree: NOT YET VERIFIED.
  pub (apps/mobile/)              84 packages: NOT YET VERIFIED (pub.dev has no
                                  licence field; read each package LICENSE).
  Fonts (web/src/fonts)           Geologica, IBM Plex Mono, Onest: SIL Open Font
                                  Licence (OFL) 1.1; texts in web/src/fonts/LICENSES.md.
  Deployment (used, not linked)   Keycloak, nginx, PostgreSQL: named for
                                  attribution only.

